---
interface Props { initialStep?: number }
const { initialStep = 1 } = Astro.props;
const steps = [['Carro de compras','Revisa tus productos'],['Tus datos','Información de contacto'],['Entrega','Envío o recojo en tienda'],['Pago','Elige cómo pagar'],['¡Listo!','Pedido confirmado']];
---
<section class="checkout" data-checkout data-step={initialStep}>
  <div class="checkout-top"><p class="eyebrow" data-eyebrow>{initialStep === 1 ? 'TU COMPRA' : `PASO ${initialStep} DE 5`}</p><h1 data-title>{initialStep === 1 ? 'Carrito' : 'Finalizar compra'}</h1></div>
  <ol class="steps" aria-label="Progreso de compra">{steps.map(([title,description], index) => <li data-marker={index + 1} class:list={{current: initialStep === index + 1, complete: initialStep > index + 1}}><span>{initialStep > index + 1 ? '✓' : index + 1}</span><b>{title}</b><small>{description}</small></li>)}</ol>
  <div class="layout"><div class="flow-card">
    <section data-panel="1"><h2>Revisa tu carrito</h2><div class="cart-table"><div class="cart-header"><b>Producto</b><b>Precio</b><b>Cantidad</b><b>Subtotal</b></div><article class="cart-item"><img src="/images/cama_lineal-600x600.webp" alt="Cama Lineal color Coral Camel"/><a href="/producto/cama-lineal/">Cama Lineal <small>2 Plazas · Coral Camel</small></a><span>S/ 1,100.00</span><div class="qty"><button>−</button><output>1</output><button>+</button></div><strong>S/ 1,100.00</strong><button class="delete" aria-label="Quitar producto">×</button></article></div><div class="cart-total"><span>Total</span><strong>S/ 1,100.00</strong><button class="button" data-next>Continuar</button></div></section>
    <section data-panel="2" hidden><p class="eyebrow">PASO 2 DE 5</p><h2>Datos de la persona</h2><p class="intro">Indica quién recibirá el pedido y cómo podemos contactarle.</p><form class="grid"><label>Nombres <em>*</em><input required placeholder="Tus nombres"/></label><label>Apellidos <em>*</em><input required placeholder="Tus apellidos"/></label><label>Correo electrónico <em>*</em><input required type="email" placeholder="correo@ejemplo.com"/></label><label>Teléfono WhatsApp <em>*</em><input required type="tel" placeholder="+51 999 999 999"/></label><label>Tipo de documento <em>*</em><select><option>DNI</option><option>CE</option><option>RUC</option></select></label><label>Número de documento <em>*</em><input required inputmode="numeric" placeholder="00000000"/></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox"/> Completar datos para factura (opcional)</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox"/> Quiero recibir novedades y promociones (opcional)</label><label class="check full"><input required type="checkbox"/> Acepto los <a href="/terminos-y-condiciones/">términos y condiciones</a> y la <a href="/politica-de-privacidad/">política de privacidad</a> <em>*</em></label></form><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" data-back>← Volver al carrito</button><button class="button" data-next>Continuar</button></div></section>
    <section data-panel="3" hidden><p class="eyebrow">PASO 3 DE 5</p><h2>Entrega o recojo en tienda</h2><p class="intro">Completa la dirección y elige cómo recibir tu compra.</p><iframe class="map" title="Ubicación de entrega" loading="lazy" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=-11.959483540827446,-77.07367553151661&z=12&output=embed"></iframe><form class="grid delivery-grid"><label>Departamento <em>*</em><input value="Lima"/></label><label>Provincia <em>*</em><input value="Lima"/></label><label>Distrito <em>*</em><input placeholder="Distrito"/></label><label>Dirección exacta <em>*</em><input placeholder="Av., calle y número"/></label><label>Referencia de llegada<input placeholder="Ej. frente al parque"/></label><label>Tipo de vivienda <em>*</em><select><option>Casa</option><option>Departamento</option></select></label></form><aside class="notice"><b>Entrega aproximada</b><span>De 3 a 5 días. Fecha aproximada sujeta a coordinación.</span></aside><h3>Elige cómo recibir tu compra</h3><p class="intro">Puedes solicitar envío o recoger en una tienda autorizada disponible.</p><label class="choice"><input checked type="radio" name="delivery"/><span>↗</span><b>Envío a domicilio <small>Envío gratuito</small></b></label><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" data-back>← Volver a tus datos</button><button class="button" data-next>Continuar al pago</button></div></section>
    <section data-panel="4" hidden><p class="eyebrow">PASO 4 DE 5</p><h2>Elige cómo pagar</h2><p class="intro">Serás dirigido a una pasarela segura para completar tu pago.</p><label class="choice payment"><input checked type="radio" name="payment"/><b>Tarjeta o billetera digital <small>Pago seguro con Izipay</small></b></label><p class="intro">Al continuar se generará tu enlace de pago seguro por el monto de tu pedido.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" data-back>← Volver a entrega</button><button class="button" data-next>Confirmar pedido</button></div></section>
    <section class="success" data-panel="5" hidden><span>✓</span><p class="eyebrow">PEDIDO REGISTRADO</p><h2>¡Gracias por tu compra!</h2><p>Hemos recibido tu pedido. Te contactaremos por WhatsApp para confirmar la producción, entrega y el enlace de pago.</p><a class="button" href="/">Volver al inicio</a></section>
  </div><aside class="summary" data-summary><button class="summary-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><b>Resumen de la compra</b><strong>S/ 1,100.00</strong><span>⌄</span></button><div class="summary-content"><div class="summary-head"><b>Producto</b><b>Subtotal</b></div><div class="summary-product"><img src="/images/cama_lineal-600x600.webp" alt=""/><span>Cama Lineal - 2 Plazas, Coral Camel <b>× 1</b></span><strong>S/ 1,100.00</strong></div><dl><div><dt>Subtotal</dt><dd>S/ 1,100.00</dd></div><div><dt>Envío</dt><dd>Envío gratuito</dd></div><div><dt>Total</dt><dd>S/ 1,100.00</dd></div></dl></div></aside></div>
</section>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('[data-checkout]').forEach((root) => { let step=Number(root.dataset.step||1); const update=()=>{root.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]').forEach(p=>p.hidden=Number(p.dataset.panel)!==step);root.querySelectorAll('[data-marker]').forEach(m=>{const n=Number(m.dataset.marker);m.classList.toggle('current',n===step);m.classList.toggle('complete',n<step);m.querySelector('span').textContent=n<step?'✓':String(n)});root.querySelector('[data-eyebrow]').textContent=step===1?'TU COMPRA':`PASO ${step} DE 5`;root.querySelector('[data-title]').textContent=step===1?'Carrito':'Finalizar compra';window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})};root.querySelectorAll('[data-next]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(step<5){step++;update()}}));root.querySelectorAll('[data-back]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(step>1){step--;update()}}));root.querySelector('.summary-toggle')?.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{const b=e.currentTarget;b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true'));root.querySelector('[data-summary]').classList.toggle('open')})});
</script>
<style>
.checkout{max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding:48px 28px 80px}.checkout-top h1{margin:3px 0 28px;font-size:40px}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:var(--brand);font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);position:relative;gap:8px;margin:0 0 38px;padding:26px 34px;list-style:none;border:1px solid #e2e6ec;border-radius:24px;background:#fff}.steps:before{position:absolute;top:55px;right:10%;left:10%;height:2px;background:#dce1e8;content:""}.steps li{z-index:1;display:grid;justify-items:center;text-align:center;color:#66758d}.steps span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:46px;height:46px;margin-bottom:12px;border:4px solid white;border-radius:50%;background:#edf0f4;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #dce1e8;font-weight:800}.steps b{color:#0c1727}.steps small{margin-top:5px}.steps .current span,.steps .complete span{color:white;background:var(--brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand)}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 390px;gap:28px}.flow-card,.summary{border:1px solid #e0e6ed;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 14px 38px #1728440a}.flow-card{padding:42px}.flow-card h2{margin:8px 0;font-size:36px}.flow-card h3{margin:30px 0 4px;font-size:23px}.intro{margin:0 0 28px;color:#62738e;font-size:18px}.cart-table{border:1px solid #e9edf1}.cart-header,.cart-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(230px,1fr) 140px 120px 140px;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:18px}.cart-header{background:#fafbfc}.cart-item{position:relative;border-top:1px solid #e9edf1}.cart-item img{width:84px;height:84px;float:left;margin-right:16px;object-fit:contain}.cart-item a{color:var(--brand);font-size:18px;text-decoration:none}.cart-item a small,.choice small{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:#64728a}.qty{display:flex;width:max-content;border:1px solid #d3dae3;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}.qty button,.qty output{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:40px;border:0;background:white;font:inherit}.qty output{border-inline:1px solid #d3dae3}.delete{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;border:0;background:transparent;font-size:24px}.cart-total{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin-top:28px;font-size:18px}.button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:46px;padding:10px 20px;border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:10px;background:var(--brand);color:white;font:700 15px inherit;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.secondary{border-color:#ccd5df;background:white;color:var(--ink)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px 24px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #e1e6ec}.grid label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-weight:700}.grid em{color:var(--brand);font-style:normal}.grid input,.grid select{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:62px;padding:0 17px;border:1px solid #cdd6e1;border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#162239;font:inherit}.grid .check{display:block;padding:18px;border:1px solid #e2e6eb;border-radius:12px;background:#f7f8fa}.grid .check input{width:auto;height:auto;margin:0 7px 0 0}.grid a{color:var(--brand)}.grid .full{grid-column:1/-1}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:32px}.map{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:320px;border:1px solid #dce3ea;border-radius:14px}.delivery-grid{margin-top:20px}.notice{display:grid;gap:4px;margin-top:22px;padding:20px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:12px;background:#eff7ff;color:#17385e}.choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:18px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:16px}.choice input{accent-color:var(--brand)}.choice>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--brand);color:white;font-size:27px}.choice b{font-size:17px}.payment{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr}.success{max-width:560px;margin:40px auto;text-align:center}.success>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:72px;height:72px;margin:auto;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-size:40px}.success p:not(.eyebrow){color:#60708a;line-height:1.6}.summary{align-self:start;padding:22px}.summary-toggle{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;width:100%;padding:0 0 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e8ed;background:none;text-align:left;font:inherit}.summary-toggle span{display:none}.summary-head,.summary-product,.summary dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 110px;gap:14px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e8ed}.summary-product{grid-template-columns:64px 1fr 110px}.summary-product img{width:58px;height:58px;object-fit:contain}.summary-product span{line-height:1.35}.summary-product span b{display:block;margin-top:6px}.summary dl{margin:0}.summary dt,.summary dd{margin:0}.summary dd{font-weight:700}.summary dl div:last-child{border-bottom:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:800}@media(max-width:900px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.summary{order:2}.cart-header,.cart-item{grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,1fr) 120px 100px 120px}.flow-card{padding:28px}}@media(max-width:650px){.checkout{padding:28px 16px 52px}.checkout-top h1{font-size:32px}.steps{margin-inline:-16px;padding:18px 6px;border-radius:0}.steps:before{top:41px}.steps span{width:34px;height:34px;margin-bottom:8px;border-width:2px}.steps b{font-size:11px}.steps small{display:none}.flow-card{padding:22px 18px;border-radius:16px}.flow-card h2{font-size:29px}.intro{font-size:16px}.cart-header{display:none}.cart-item{grid-template-columns:82px 1fr;gap:10px;padding-right:25px}.cart-item img{grid-row:span 3;width:72px;height:72px;margin:0}.cart-item>a,.cart-item>span,.cart-item>.qty,.cart-item>strong{grid-column:2}.cart-total{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:13px}.cart-total span{margin-right:auto}.cart-total .button{width:100%}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid .full{grid-column:auto}.actions{align-items:stretch}.actions .button{flex:1;padding-inline:10px;font-size:13px}.map{height:230px}.summary{padding:0;border-radius:16px}.summary-toggle{padding:20px}.summary-toggle span{display:block}.summary-content{display:none;padding:0 20px}.summary.open .summary-content{display:block}.summary-product{grid-template-columns:54px 1fr 90px}.summary-product img{width:48px;height:48px}.summary-head,.summary dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr 90px}}
</style>
